# Delivery flow

Do **not** implement product code (crates, locales for features, YAML behavior) in this Cursor clone. When a rule is decided, write it into `docs/REQUIREMENTS.md` (and `docs/GUI_WIREFRAMES.md` if the UI changes), **then** open or refine a GitHub issue. Codex implements in `yaRomChecker-codex` and opens a `codex` PR with `Fixes #N`.

When a Codex PR exists (including one just opened in this session): **immediately** fetch it, run `cargo test --workspace` and `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`, review the code against the issue and `docs/REQUIREMENTS.md` (not tests alone), comment on GitHub for Codex, and **present a review report in chat in the same turn**. Do not wait for the human to ask. Do not push to the Codex branch. **If the verdict is accept, merge the PR in that same turn.** Do not merge on request changes or blocked.

Full text: `AGENTS.md`. Spec/process doc edits in this clone are allowed. Chat-only decisions are not in force until they appear in `docs/REQUIREMENTS.md`.
